s=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">#113</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>五月<rt>ごがつ</rt></ruby><ruby>病<rt>びょう</rt></ruby>は<ruby>大丈夫<rt>だいじょうぶ</rt></ruby>ですか</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s2\">？？？</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>は<ruby>全然<rt>ぜんぜん</rt></ruby><ruby>大丈夫<rt>だいじょうぶ</rt></ruby>です</span><span class=\"s3\">✨</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>中学生<rt>ちゅうがくせい</rt></ruby>の<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>は<ruby>良<rt>よ</rt></ruby>くなってましたけどね</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s2\">（<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby>）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ちなみにこのゴールデンウィークは<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>のとっても<ruby>大好<rt>だいす</rt></ruby>きな<ruby>名<rt>めい</rt></ruby><ruby>探偵<rt>たんてい</rt></ruby>コナンの<ruby>映画<rt>えいが</rt></ruby>「<ruby>名<rt>めい</rt></ruby><ruby>探偵<rt>たんてい</rt></ruby>コナン</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>紺青<rt>こんじょう</rt></ruby>の<ruby>拳<rt>こぶし</rt></ruby>」を</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>回<rt>かい</rt></ruby>も<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>れました</span><span class=\"s3\">😶</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>回<rt>かい</rt></ruby><ruby>目<rt>め</rt></ruby>は<ruby>丹生<rt>たんじょう</rt></ruby>ちゃんと<ruby>行<rt>おこな</rt></ruby>って、</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>回<rt>かい</rt></ruby><ruby>目<rt>め</rt></ruby>は<ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めて</span><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>で<ruby>行<rt>おこな</rt></ruby>ってきました！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ゴールデンウィーク</span><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>番<rt>ばん</rt></ruby>の<ruby>収穫<rt>しゅうかく</rt></ruby><ruby>源<rt>げん</rt></ruby>ですね</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️☺️</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>同<rt>おな</rt></ruby>じく、<ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きだよーって<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>がいたら<ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>とかで<ruby>直接<rt>ちょくせつ</rt></ruby>お<ruby>話<rt>はなし</rt></ruby>とかしたいですね</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s2\">(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">その<ruby>繋<rt>つな</rt></ruby>がりで、<ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby>は</span><span class=\"s1\">CHICO</span><span class=\"s2\">さんの「アイのシナリオ」とポルノグラフィティさんの「オー！リバル」をよく<ruby>聴<rt>き</rt></ruby>いています</span><span class=\"s3\">🧐</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>余韻<rt>よいん</rt></ruby>に<ruby>浸<rt>ひた</rt></ruby>っています</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s7\">♪♪♪</span></span></p></div>\n                    ",
